{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T22:40:00+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Business Tour - Board Game with Online Multiplayer", "steam_appid": 397900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2305860, 2305850, 915590, 1331280, 1024050, 862610, 842000, 819240, 797240, 716790], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397900/extras/1da67d47b4082b0b0e54f4df0c93d1cc.avif?t=1790319806\" width=640 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Business Tour</strong> is a multiplayer board game that combines simple rules with strategy, competition, and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is different. Buy properties, build your strategy, negotiate with your rivals, make temporary alliances — and break them when the time is right. Your decisions can change the course of the game, but you'll also need to adapt when things don't go according to plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397900/extras/e57547e59d0ccb6a00377e4d5c7e1eeb.poster.avif?t=1790319806\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397900/extras/e57547e59d0ccb6a00377e4d5c7e1eeb.webm?t=1790319806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397900/extras/e57547e59d0ccb6a00377e4d5c7e1eeb.mp4?t=1790319806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, challenging to win.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business Tour is simple to pick up, even if you've never played before. But winning against real players takes strategy, smart decisions, and a little bit of luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with friends or challenge players from around the world. Team up for 2v2 matches, compete in tournaments and climb the leaderboards — or enjoy the game offline with bots and friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397900/extras/8154b0da0a757c7ef97b451c11c60f9d.avif?t=1790319806\" width=640 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing competitively or just having fun with friends, no two matches play out exactly the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397900/extras/198fb3a9853d81dfca76bcf33aab7a67.poster.avif?t=1790319806\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397900/extras/198fb3a9853d81dfca76bcf33aab7a67.webm?t=1790319806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397900/extras/198fb3a9853d81dfca76bcf33aab7a67.mp4?t=1790319806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397900/extras/c678df40ebce49290a7f60c1f27dad6e.poster.avif?t=1790319806\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397900/extras/c678df40ebce49290a7f60c1f27dad6e.webm?t=1790319806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397900/extras/c678df40ebce49290a7f60c1f27dad6e.mp4?t=1790319806\" typ